OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Molly-Mae to Gemma Collins -
OL,4,Afilming the real lives behind the
OL,5,Aheadlines
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen producer Demi Doyle was invited
OL,8,Fround to the home of Molly-Mae Hague to
OL,9,Fdiscuss the possibility of filming a
OL,10,Fnew docuseries, she knew they needed to
OL,11,Fcapture the highs, the lows and the
OL,12,Fbeautifully mundane moments in between.
OL,14,FDemi had recently set up her own TV
OL,15,Fproduction company Navybee under the
OL,16,Fumbrella of the Manchester-based
OL,17,FWorkerbee Group, which is part of
OL,18,FBanijay Entertainment.
OL,20,FThis would be the label's first
OL,21,Fcommission.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
