OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Molly-Mae to Gemma Collins -
OL,4,Afilming the real lives behind the
OL,5,Aheadlines
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I just remember calling her agent
OL,8,FFran, who's amazing, and they were
OL,9,Falready wanting to do something on the
OL,10,Fwedding," said Demi, who had previously
OL,11,Ffilmed Molly-Mae for the Netflix series
OL,12,FAt Home with the Furys.
